invalid type: string "Stay up to date on the latest UI/UX trends.\nAs you build foundational and more advanced UX skills, subscribe to a few top\nUX blogs and podcasts\nto keep yourself informed on the latest trends. You can learn a lot from the wealth of free UX resources.\nPut your UX skills into practice.\ns for things like typography, color theory, layout, icons, and general design theory.pus 